---
manual: rules.redirection.slot_editing_stack
lines: [251, 254]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @column = stack do
    para "Inside"
  end
  @after = para "After"
end
----------- test code
assert_equal ["Inside"], stack("@column").contents.map(&:text), "the stack holds only what its block drew"
assert_equal [stack("@column").linkable_id, para("@after").linkable_id],
  Shoes.APPS.first.document_root.contents.map(&:linkable_id),
  "the stack is popped when its block ends, so the next para goes back to the top slot"
